      {
        "id": 17661,
        "title": "setInterval e clearInterval",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149767,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setInterval()</code> é outro método nativo do JavaScript que executa código de forma assíncrona.</p><p>Com <code>setInterval</code> podemos executar uma pequena parte de um loop de jogo a cada período de tempo definido. Vamos aprender mais sobre este método.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149768,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setInterval()</code> recebe uma função de callback e um intervalo como parâmetros. Aqui, <code>toggleInvincibility</code> alterna a invencibilidade do jogador entre ligada e desligada.</p><p>Passe a função de callback e o intervalo para a chamada <code>setInterval</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"217\" endIndex=\"228\" /><option startIndex=\"229\" endIndex=\"248\" /><option startIndex=\"250\" endIndex=\"253\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toggleInvincibility = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isInvincible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility off&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility on&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setInterval(toggleInvincibility, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>setInterval</code> seguido de <code>toggleInvincibility</code> e finalmente <code>500</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149769,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setInterval</code> executa a função de callback para sempre, com um atraso do número especificado de milissegundos que passamos como o segundo parâmetro.</p><p>A primeira execução do callback ocorre após o tempo especificado. Ele não é executado imediatamente.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"250\" endIndex=\"253\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toggleInvincibility = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isInvincible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility off&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility on&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setInterval(toggleInvincibility, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>500</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149770,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se executarmos o código, podemos obter um erro de timeout porque não há uma parada para o <code>setInterval</code>.</p><p>Adicione <code>500</code> milissegundos aqui para ver o power-up piscar para sempre a cada <code>500</code> milissegundos!</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"215\" endIndex=\"218\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setInterval(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPowerUpVisible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up hidden&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up visible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>500</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149771,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para parar o <code>setInterval()</code> de rodar indefinidamente, podemos usar o método <code>clearInterval</code>.<br /></p><p>Podemos salvar o <code>setInterval</code> em uma variável <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code>. Em seguida, usar <code>clearInterval(powerUpBlinkInterval)</code> dentro de um <code>setTimeout</code> para ser executado após <code>2500</code> milissegundos.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"268\" endIndex=\"281\" /><option startIndex=\"282\" endIndex=\"302\" /><option startIndex=\"340\" endIndex=\"344\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" powerUpBlinkInterval = setInterval(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPowerUpVisible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up hidden&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up visible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(powerUpBlinkInterval);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up ended&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>let</code> seguido de <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code> e depois <code>clearInterval</code>, <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code>, <code>2500</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149772,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O método <code>clearInterval()</code> recebe o <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code> como seu único parâmetro.</p><p>Na execução, ele interrompe a ação repetitiva do método <code>setInterval()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"268\" endIndex=\"281\" /><option startIndex=\"282\" endIndex=\"302\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" powerUpBlinkInterval = setInterval(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPowerUpVisible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up hidden&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up visible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(powerUpBlinkInterval);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up ended&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>clearInterval</code> seguido de <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149773,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é um método JavaScript que executa código de forma assíncrona?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>setInterval()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.filter()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>setInterval()</code>.</p></body></html>"
